{"questions":[{"question_id":"lsbmt320","content":"Given below are two statements :<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (I)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are same organic compounds.<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (II)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds.<br/><br/>\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> answer from the options given below :","chapter":"compounds-containing-nitrogen","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","isBonus":false,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"languages":["en"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-1st-february-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift","permalink":"given-below-are-two-statements-brbr-bstatement-i-jee-main-chemistry-dpen5ibnd1xjteoc","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"Given below are two statements :<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (I)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are same organic compounds.<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (II)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds.<br/><br/>\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> answer from the options given below :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are correct"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Statement (I) says that aminobenzene and aniline are the same organic compounds. Statement (II) says that aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds. To evaluate these statements, let's examine what each name refers to.</p>\n\n<p>Aminobenzene and aniline both refer to the same compound, which has the chemical formula <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. This molecule consists of a benzene ring with an amino group (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.877ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2155.6 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) attached to it. Aminobenzene is a name that describes the structure based on its functional groups - an amino group attached to a benzene ring. Aniline is the common name for this compound and is recognized by IUPAC as an acceptable name.</p>\n\n<p>Given this information:</p>\n<p>Statement I is correct because aminobenzene and aniline refer to the same compound, that is, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Statement II is incorrect because it states that aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds, which is not true.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the most appropriate answer from the given options is:</p>\n<p>Option C\nStatement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect.</p>"},"hi":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"नीचे दो कथन दिए गए हैं:<br/><br/>\n<b>कथन (I)</b> : एमिनोबेन्ज़ीन और एनिलिन एक ही जैविक यौगिक हैं।<br/><br/>\n<b>कथन (II)</b> : एमिनोबेन्ज़ीन और एनिलिन भिन्न जैविक यौगिक हैं।<br/><br/>\nउपर्युक्त कथनों के प्रकाश में, नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से <b>सबसे उपयुक्त</b> उत्तर चुनें :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"कथन I और कथन II दोनों सही हैं"},{"identifier":"B","content":"कथन I गलत है लेकिन कथन II सही है"},{"identifier":"C","content":"कथन I सही है लेकिन कथन II गलत है"},{"identifier":"D","content":"कथन I और कथन II दोनों गलत हैं"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>कथन (I) कहता है कि एमिनोबेंजीन और एनिलीन एक ही कार्बनिक यौगिक हैं। कथन (II) कहता है कि एमिनोबेंजीन और एनिलीन भिन्न कार्बनिक यौगिक हैं। इन कथनों का मूल्यांकन करने के लिए, आइए जानें कि प्रत्येक नाम किसे संदर्भित करता है।</p>\n\n<p>एमिनोबेंजीन और एनिलीन दोनों एक ही यौगिक को संदर्भित करते हैं, जिसका रासायनिक सूत्र <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> है। यह अणु एक बेंजीन वलय से मिलकर बनता है जिसमें एक एमिनो समूह (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.877ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2155.6 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) जुड़ा होता है। एमिनोबेंजीन एक नाम है जो इसकी संरचना को इसके क्रियात्मक समूहों के आधार पर वर्णित करता है - एक बेंजीन वलय से जुड़ा एक एमिनो समूह। एनिलीन इस यौगिक का सामान्य नाम है और IUPAC द्वारा स्वीकार्य नाम के रूप में मान्यता प्राप्त है।</p>\n\n<p>इस जानकारी को देखते हुए:</p>\n<p>कथन I सही है क्योंकि एमिनोबेंजीन और एनिलीन एक ही यौगिक को संदर्भित करते हैं, अर्थात्, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>।</p>\n<p>कथन II गलत है क्योंकि यह कहता है कि एमिनोबेंजीन और एनिलीन भिन्न कार्बनिक यौगिक हैं, जो सत्य नहीं है।</p>\n\n<p>इसलिए, दिए गए विकल्पों में से सबसे उपयुक्त उत्तर है:</p>\n<p>विकल्प C\nकथन I सही है लेकिन कथन II गलत है।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"aromatic-amines","type":"mcq","year":2024,"tags":["assertion_reason"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-1st-february-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are correct"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation"